                {
                    "question": "Do I need to marinate hanger steak?",
                    "answer": "Not strictly, but a short acidic marinade of 30 minutes to 2 hours helps tenderize the coarse grain and balances its strong, mineral-forward flavor. Longer than a few hours can start to mush the surface texture.",
                },
