                "Spoon dollops of each color into a 9x5-inch loaf pan or airtight freezer container, alternating colors as you go.",
                "Drag a butter knife through the mixture in a loose zigzag to marble the colors together, stopping before the swirls blend into a single shade.",
                "Cover tightly with plastic wrap pressed against the surface, then a lid or foil, and freeze at least 6 hours or overnight until firm.",
                "Let sit at room temperature for 5 minutes before scooping.",
