                "Bring the water to a boil over high heat, then add the crab leg clusters to the steamer basket, stacking them if needed. Cover and steam for 5-6 minutes if thawed, or 10-12 minutes if still partially frozen, until the shells are hot to the touch and the meat is opaque and warmed through.",
